# Possessor of a Precious Soul - 2 (Q242), first part, played by a level 76 human Gladiator on
# its level 60 Sorcerer subclass holding Virgil's letter: Virgil starts the quest as he is talked
# to and takes the letter; Kassandra, Ogmar and the Mysterious Dark Knight send the player to the
# angel corpses, the first of which is searched and leaves the world; then relog. Expectations
# replay the reference trace of this scenario.
